# text = It was a very muddy boot , and may introduce the odd circumstance connected with Mr . Cruncher's domestic economy , that , whereas he often came home after banking hours with clean boots , he often got up next morning to find the same boots covered with clay said Mr . Cruncher , varying his apostrophe after missing his mark Master Cruncher ( who was in his shirt ) took this very ill , and , turning to his mother , strongly deprecated any praying away of his personal board said Mr . Cruncher , with unconscious inconsistency repeated Mr . Cruncher said Mr . Cruncher , who all this time had been putting on his clothes here he addressed his wife once more Growling , in addition , such phrases as and throwing off other sarcastic sparks from the whirling grindstone of his indignation , Mr . Cruncher betook himself to his boot-cleaning and his general preparation for business .
