# text = As the ancient clerk deliberately folded and superscribed the note , Mr . Cruncher , after surveying him in silence until he came to the blotting-paper stage , remarked said Jerry remarked the ancient clerk , turning his surprised spectacles upon him retained the ancient clerk said Jerry said the old clerk Jerry took the letter , and , remarking to himself with less internal deference than he made an outward show of made his bow , informed his son , in passing , of his destination , and went his way .
