# text = Stryver never had a case in hand , anywhere , but Carton was there , with his hands in his pockets , staring at the ceiling of the court ; they went the same Circuit , and even there they prolonged their usual orgies late into the night , and Carton was rumoured to be seen at broad day , going home stealthily and unsteadily to his lodgings , like a dissipated cat .
