# text = At last , it began to get about , among such as were interested in the matter , that although Sydney Carton would never be a lion , he was an amazingly good jackal , and that he rendered suit and service to Stryver in that humble capacity said the man at the tavern , whom he had charged to wake him After a few dull efforts to get to sleep again , which the man dexterously combated by stirring the fire continuously for five minutes , he got up , tossed his hat on , and walked out .
