# text = Firstly , because , on fine Sundays , he often walked out , before dinner , with the Doctor and Lucie ; secondly , because , on unfavourable Sundays , he was accustomed to be with them as the family friend , talking , reading , looking out of window , and generally getting through the day ; thirdly , because he happened to have his own little shrewd doubts to solve , and knew how the ways of the Doctor's household pointed to that time as a likely time for solving them .
