# text = The first was the best room , and in it were Lucie's birds , and flowers , and books , and desk , and work-table , and box of water-colours ; the second was the Doctor's consulting-room , used also as the dining-room ; the third , changingly speckled by the rustle of the plane-tree in the yard , was the Doctor's bedroom , and there , in a corner , stood the disused shoemaker's bench and tray of tools , much as it had stood on the fifth floor of the dismal house by the wine-shop , in the suburb of Saint Antoine in Paris said Mr . Lorry , pausing in his looking about was the abrupt inquiry that made him start .
