# text = He knew enough of the world to know that there is nothing in it better than the faithful service of the heart ; so rendered and so free from any mercenary taint , he had such an exalted respect for it , that in the retributive arrangements made by his own mind -- we all make such arrangements , more or less -- he stationed Miss Pross much nearer to the lower Angels than many ladies immeasurably better got up both by Nature and Art , who had balances at Tellson's said Miss Pross Here again : Mr .
