# text = As for the roof he vaunted , he might have found _that_ shutting out the sky in a new way -- to wit , for ever , from the eyes of the bodies into which its lead was fired , out of the barrels of a hundred thousand muskets said the Marquis said the nephew repeated the Marquis , with an inquiring smile , and delicately pointing , first to his nephew , then to himself said the Marquis answered the nephew said the Marquis , touching him on the breast with his forefinger -- they were now standing by the hearth Every fine straight line in the clear whiteness of his face , was cruelly , craftily , and closely compressed , while he stood looking quietly at his nephew , with his snuff-box in his hand .
