# text = It had taken a deal of extra wet-towelling to pull him through the night ; a correspondingly extra quantity of wine had preceded the towelling ; and he was in a very damaged condition , as he now pulled his turban off and threw it into the basin in which he had steeped it at intervals for the last six hours said Stryver the portly , with his hands in his waistband , glancing round from the sofa where he lay on his back said Stryver , coming slowly into a sitting posture returned Sydney , busy concocting the punch rejoined Stryver , laughing boastfully suggested Carton said Stryver , inflating himself at his friend as he made the punch said Sydney Carton said Stryver , shaking his head in his bullying way returned Sydney rejoined Stryver , shouldering the rejoinder at him Sydney drank a bumper of the punch he had made , and laughed said Stryver , squaring himself muttered Carton answered Carton , with a careless air He asked the question with some appearance of scorn was his friend's answer , delivered in no very soothing tone said Sydney Carton said Mr . Stryver , preparing him with ostentatious friendliness for the disclosure he was about to make Sydney Carton looked at his punch and looked at his complacent friend ; drank his punch and looked at his complacent friend Sydney Carton drank the punch at a great rate ; drank it by bumpers , looking at his friend said Mr . Stryver Carton , still drinking the punch , rejoined Carton , still drinking the punch , rejoined said his friend Stryver
