# text = The mender of roads was now coming to himself , and was mistrustful of having made a mistake in his late demonstrations ; but no said Defarge , in his ear cried the mender of roads , reflectively Madame Defarge looked superciliously at the client , and nodded in confirmation said she said Madame Defarge , with a wave of her hand towards the place where they had last been apparent Madame Defarge and monsieur her husband returned amicably to the bosom of Saint Antoine , while a speck in a blue cap toiled through the darkness , and through the dust , and down the weary miles of avenue by the wayside , slowly tending towards that point of the compass where the chateau of Monsieur the Marquis , now in his grave , listened to the whispering trees .
