# text = But , he had been so careful to get it accurately , that he then spelt it with perfect correctness repeated madame repeated madame , after murmuring it once to herself said madame , laughing They turned into the wine-shop , which was closed ( for it was midnight ), and where Madame Defarge immediately took her post at her desk , counted the small moneys that had been taken during her absence , examined the stock , went through the entries in the book , made other entries of her own , checked the serving man in every possible way , and finally dismissed him to bed .
