# text = He whiffed the compound of scents away , as he put down his smoked-out pipe said madame , raising her glance as she knotted the money her husband acknowledged said madame , whose quick eyes had never been so intent on the accounts , but they had had a ray or two for him began Defarge repeated madame , nodding firmly said Defarge , as if a thought were wrung out of his breast repeated his wife said Defarge demanded madame , composedly Defarge raised his head thoughtfully , as if there were something in that too said madame said Defarge She tied a knot with flashing eyes , as if it throttled a foe said madame , extending her right hand , for emphasis returned Defarge , standing before her with his head a little bent , and his hands clasped at his back , like a docile and attentive pupil before his catechist demanded madame , tying another knot , as if there were another enemy strangled said Defarge , with a half complaining and half apologetic shrug returned madame , with her extended hand in strong action
