# text = As the keeper of the wine-shop entered at the door , the spy saluted him by touching his hat , and saying , with an engaging smile Defarge stopped short , and stared at him the spy repeated ; with not quite so much confidence , or quite so easy a smile under the stare returned the keeper of the wine-shop said the spy , airily , but discomfited too answered Defarge , drily said Defarge , shaking his head Having said it , he passed behind the little counter , and stood with his hand on the back of his wife's chair , looking over that barrier at the person to whom they were both opposed , and whom either of them would have shot with the greatest satisfaction .
