# text = The short , rather plump wife of a starved grocer , and the mother of two children withal , this lieutenant had already earned the complimentary name of The Vengeance said The Vengeance As if a train of powder laid from the outermost bound of Saint Antoine Quarter to the wine-shop door , had been suddenly fired , a fast-spreading murmur came rushing along said madame Defarge came in breathless , pulled off a red cap he wore , and looked around him said madame again Defarge stood , panting , against a background of eager eyes and open mouths , formed outside the door ; all those within the wine-shop had sprung to their feet cried madame , contemptuously from all throats from the universal throat again Wretched old sinner of more than threescore years and ten , if he had never known it yet , he would have known it in his heart of hearts if he could have heard the answering cry .
