# text = Monsieur Gabelle had held the impoverished and involved estate on written instructions , to spare the people , to give them what little there was to give -- such fuel as the heavy creditors would let them have in the winter , and such produce as could be saved from the same grip in the summer -- and no doubt he had put the fact in plea and proof , for his own safety , so that it could not but appear now .
