# text = The lady in question , whose rooted conviction that she was more than a match for any foreigner , was not to be shaken by distress and , danger , appeared with folded arms , and observed in English to The Vengeance , whom her eyes first encountered She also bestowed a British cough on Madame Defarge ; but , neither of the two took much heed of her said Madame Defarge , stopping in her work for the first time , and pointing her knitting-needle at little Lucie as if it were the finger of Fate answered Mr . Lorry
