# text = The shadow attendant on Madame Defarge and her party seemed then to fall , threatening and dark , on both the mother and the child said Madame Defarge But , the suppressed manner had enough of menace in it -- not visible and presented , but indistinct and withheld -- to alarm Lucie into saying , as she laid her appealing hand on Madame Defarge's dress returned Madame Defarge , looking down at her with perfect composure Madame Defarge received it as a compliment , and looked at her husband .
