# text = Defarge , who had been uneasily biting his thumb-nail and looking at her , collected his face into a sterner expression asked Madame Defarge , with a lowering smile said Lucie , hurriedly taking the paper from her breast , but with her alarmed eyes on her questioner and not on it said Madame Defarge cried Lucie , most earnestly Madame Defarge looked , coldly as ever , at the suppliant , and said , turning to her friend The Vengeance returned The Vengeance said Madame Defarge , turning her eyes again upon Lucie She resumed her knitting and went out .
