# text = The preceding relative positions of himself and Lucie were reversed , yet only as the liveliest gratitude and affection could reverse them , for he could have had no pride but in rendering some service to her who had rendered so much to him thought Mr . Lorry , in his amiably shrewd way But , though the Doctor tried hard , and never ceased trying , to get Charles Darnay set at liberty , or at least to get him brought to trial , the public current of the time set too strong and fast for him .
