# text = His practised eye saw it , and made the most of it said the spy , casting a reproachful look at his sister exclaimed Sydney Miss Pross recalled soon afterwards , and to the end of her life remembered , that as she pressed her hands on Sydney's arm and looked up in his face , imploring him to do no hurt to Solomon , there was a braced purpose in the arm and a kind of inspiration in the eyes , which not only contradicted his light manner , but changed and raised the man .
