# text = While he was at a loss , Carton said , resuming his former air of contemplating cards said the spy , quickly repeated Carton , musing , and not appearing to notice him at all , though he echoed his word said the spy repeated Carton , in the same mechanical way said the spy muttered Sydney Carton , retrospectively , and idling his glass ( which fortunately was a small one ) again said the spy cried Carton , striking his open hand on the table , as a light broke clearly on his mind said Barsad , with a smile that gave his aquiline nose an extra inclination to one side Here , Mr .
