# text = With a solemn interest in the lighted windows where the people were going to rest , forgetful through a few calm hours of the horrors surrounding them ; in the towers of the churches , where no prayers were said , for the popular revulsion had even travelled that length of self-destruction from years of priestly impostors , plunderers , and profligates ; in the distant burial-places , reserved , as they wrote upon the gates , for Eternal Sleep ; in the abounding gaols ; and in the streets along which the sixties rolled to a death which had become so common and material , that no sorrowful story of a haunting Spirit ever arose among the people out of all the working of the Guillotine ; with a solemn interest in the whole life and death of the city settling down to its short nightly pause in fury ; Sydney Carton crossed the Seine again for the lighter streets .
